        "time_line_item_zYFW77": {
          "type": "time_line_item",
          "settings": {
            "time_title": "2020.05",
            "timeline_text": "<p>karakubuyオンラインストアが誕生。<br/>常に「世界に幸せを作る」大きな夢を持った7名だけの小さなチームからスタート。</p>",
            "time_image": "shopify://shop_images/2020.5.jpg",
            "time_anchor": "data-2020-05"
          }
        },
        "time_line_item_33r4DV": {
          "type": "time_line_item",
          "settings": {
            "time_title": "2020.12",
            "timeline_text": "<p>ヴィンテージクローズを中心とした優良サプライヤと工場を探索。<br/>品質マネジメントシステムを確立し、商品の設計から、製造、販売、アフターサービスに至るすべてのプロセスにおいて、商品の高品質確保のための取り組みを実行。</p>",
            "time_image": "shopify://shop_images/2020.12.jpg",
            "time_anchor": ""
          }
        },
        "time_line_item_CX4YHp": {
          "type": "time_line_item",
          "settings": {
            "time_title": "2021.07",
            "timeline_text": "<p>「日本の伝統が受け継ぐ」藍染アイテムをスタート、オリジナルアロハシャツ、一点物のヴィンテージクローズ、小物などを展開。 </p>",
            "time_image": "shopify://shop_images/2021.7.jpg",
            "time_anchor": "data-2021-07"
          }
        },
        "time_line_item_yRmGd7": {
          "type": "time_line_item",
          "settings": {
            "time_title": "2022.02",
            "timeline_text": "<p>会員ステージ制度を設定。</p>",
            "time_image": "shopify://shop_images/2022.2.jpg",
            "time_anchor": "data-2022-02"
          }
        },
        "time_line_item_eH8ddg": {
          "type": "time_line_item",
          "settings": {
            "time_title": "2022.05",
            "timeline_text": "<p>無事に2歳の誕生日を迎えることができた。</p>",
            "time_image": "shopify://shop_images/2022.5.jpg",
            "time_anchor": ""
          }
        },
        "time_line_item_ReFe9e": {
          "type": "time_line_item",
          "settings": {
            "time_title": "2022.09",
            "timeline_text": "<p>会員数10万人突破。</p>",
            "time_image": "shopify://shop_images/2022.9.jpg",
            "time_anchor": ""
          }
        },
        "time_line_item_y4BW9B": {
          "type": "time_line_item",
          "settings": {
            "time_title": "2022.12",
            "timeline_text": "<p>2022年12月、注文数が前年比3倍に増加。</p>",
            "time_image": "shopify://shop_images/2022.12.jpg",
            "time_anchor": ""
          }
        },
        "time_line_item_rL33Ut": {
          "type": "time_line_item",
          "settings": {
            "time_title": "2023.02",
            "timeline_text": "<p>BAJと協力し寄付プロジェクトをスタート、私たちの義務と価値を感じた。</p>",
            "time_image": "shopify://shop_images/2023.2.jpg",
            "time_anchor": "data-2023-02"
          }
        },
        "time_line_item_k6PKXe": {
          "type": "time_line_item",
          "settings": {
            "time_title": "2023.05",
            "timeline_text": "<p>3歳誕生日を迎え、500名以上のVIP客に専用VIPカードを贈った。</p>",
            "time_image": "shopify://shop_images/2023.5.jpg",
            "time_anchor": ""
          }
        },
        "time_line_item_HTBBwt": {
          "type": "time_line_item",
          "settings": {
            "time_title": "2023.11",
            "timeline_text": "<p>韓国オンラインショップを開設。</p>",
            "time_image": "shopify://shop_images/166_about-us.jpg",
            "time_anchor": ""
          }
        },
        "time_line_item_EtpPi8": {
          "type": "time_line_item",
          "settings": {
            "time_title": "2024.02",
            "timeline_text": "<p>Begin 雑誌4月号に掲載。</p>",
            "time_image": "shopify://shop_images/777.jpg",
